    <briefdescription>
<para>OR(...) - Logical OR operation (Excel-compatible). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Returns true if AT LEAST ONE argument is true or truthy. For arrays: returns true if ANY element is truthy.</para>
<para>Examples: OR(false, false, true) =&gt; true OR(false, false, false) =&gt; false OR([0, 0, 1]) =&gt; true </para>
    </detaileddescription>
